#AREA Kingdom of Saurong~
#AUTHORS MadMardigan~



#HELPS
1 Saurong~
Saurong is an old city comprised of a people sworn devotedly to King 
Eliador.  Within the past several years the Kingdom of Saurong has been 
under constant attack from outside warlords. The city has been strong 
however, and they have fought off all of the evil oppressors. More
importantly, something drastic has happened to the King. His beautiful daughter,
the Princess of Saurong has been kidnapped. The King is in desperate need of a
hero to rescue her. You are his only hope.

The Kingdom of Saurong is located east of Medusa's Castle, and requires the
completion of a quest in order to enter. Pay particular attention
to the description on the large tree blocking your entrance into Saurong.
My only hint for this quest, is an item that you will need to get that is
located somewhere in Medusa's Castle. 

{110}**Area creators note**
{300}Hello to all fellow Mortal Realmers. I hope that you enjoy my area. I have
spent countless hours on creating it. Despite full-time school and work it 
took me a year to complete it. My area may not be as profound 
as the other great area creators out there, but I take great pride in what
I have made here. I ask of you to take time to examine my area and all of 
its contents in detail. I think you will find the area to be 
challenging yet conquerable. Please keep in mind that the area consists of
several random programs, which depending on the percentage roll affects how
quickly the mobs speak to you. I suggest not rushing through the area, but
instead patiently wait to make sure the mobs are done talking to you. In many
cases I have indicated when they are done talking.

I want to thank Picard and all of the area admins, especially Jaxom in helping 
me code the more difficult obj_progs and mob_progs. Thanks also to Morbidos and
Grimace for some of their great ideas.  {120} 05/31/99{300}

Thank You, and Good Luck!
MadMardigan       {120}Last updated 06/16/01{300}
~
0 $~

#RANGES 75 95 0 99
#FLAGS AFLAG_NODEBUG|AFLAG_NOTELEPORT
#MOBILES
#31700
saurong gate~
A Saurong Gatekeeper~
A Saurong Gatekeeper looks at you suspiciously.~
{060}The gatekeeper could use you as a punching bag. He is huge.~
ACT_SMART|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SENTINEL
AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_TONGUES
800 S
85 0 0 10000d1+2000 10d10+10
26754 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
  tell $n Do you come to Saurong in peace?
~ 

>speech_prog p yes~
  say Then Welcome to Our City!
  mpecho $I opens the City Gates.
  mptransfer $n 31701
~  

>speech_prog p no~
  say Then get lost!
  mpechoat $n $I picks you up and throws you.
  mptransfer $n 9755
~
