#31703
peasant~
A Peasant~
A Peasant is here eating with his wife.~
{060}He looks dirt poor.~
ACT_WEAK|ACT_SMART|ACT_SENTINEL
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN
10 S
55 0 0 2000d1+0 10d8+2
2 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
  if quest(7, 3, $n) == 0
          mpechoat $n $I jumps at your throat with his knife!!
          tell $n Oh, sorry I thought you were a looter.
          tell $n You arn't a looter, Right?
          look $n
          mpmset $n quest 7 3 1
  endif
~

>all_greet_prog 100~
      if quest(7, 3, $n) == 5
          hug $n
          say Oh, you are so kind. Thank you very much for paying my taxes. 
          say I wish I had something good to give you.
          mpecho $I looks around desperately.
          tell $n Its not much but perhaps you could use this.
          mpquiet on
          mpoload 31716
          c 'giant strength' $n
          mpquiet off
          give crystal $n
          mpmset $n quest 7 3 6
      endif
      
    if quest(16, 4, $n) == 8
         if quest(7, 3, $n) == 6 
            if quest(20, 2, $n) == 3
               if quest(10, 3, $n) == 6
                  if quest(4, 3, $n) == 6
                         mpmset $n quest 0 4 5
                         tell $n Well done, you have retrieved all of the crystals.
                     endif
                  endif
            endif
         endif
    endif   
~
>all_greet_prog 100~
      if quest(7, 3, $n) == 6
          hug $n
          say I really appreciate it!
      endif
~

>speech_prog p right~
    if quest(7, 3, $n) == 1
          say Thank goodness. We have been having some problems with Looters
          say vandalizing houses in this area. 
          say Just making sure.
          mpmset $n quest 7 3 2
    endif
~

>speech_prog p looters~
   if quest(7, 3, $n) == 2
      say They are nothing but low level scum. I have been trying
      say so hard to provide for my family and to keep from losing
      say our House but they just keep stealing everything.
      mpmset $n quest 7 3 3
   endif
~

>speech_prog p house~
   if quest(7, 3, $n) == 3
      say If you noticed the conditions of the houses on this 
      say street, you would understand. People just can't afford to 
      say keep their homes anymore, because of all the vandalizing and
      say fighting going on.
      say Even I am in jeopardy of losing my home if I cant come
      say up with 5 million gold to pay the tax collector.
      mpmset $n quest 7 3 4
   endif
~
