>all_greet_prog 100~
mpechoat $n $I smiles at you.
if time() <= 11
  tell $n Good Morning!
else
  if time() <= 15
        tell $n Good Afternoon!
  else
    if time() <= 23
           tell $n Good Evening!
    endif
  endif
 endif

if actorhasobjnum(31704)
        tell $n That pendant looks good on you.
