#31712
Shuagan~
Shuagan ~
Shuagan, the WhiteKnight gang leader stands here.~
{060}He is a very handsome looking fellow with blue eyes and blonde hair.
He looks at you intelligently.~
ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART
AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_DETECT_INVIS
0 S
90 0 0 9000d1+0 10d10+29
5000 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
 if quest(0, 4, $n) == 0
   tell $n You got balls coming in here man!
   tell $n It looks as though you did well getting past my boys.
   tell $n If that is the case, then perhaps you are strong enough 
   tell $n to accomplish a Task for me?
 else
   nod $n
endif
~ 
>speech_prog p task~ 
if quest(0, 4, $n) == 0
   say I want to try and get Johuda to join an alliance 
   say with me. Our city has been under constant bombardment from 
   say outsiders and we can not afford to lose the lives of anymore 
   say of our men by fighting amongst each other.
   say Take this letter to him.
   mpquiet on
   mpoload 31705
   c 'giant strength' $n
   mpquiet off
   give letter $n
   mpmset $n quest 0 4 1
   say Ohh, Wait!
   say Here, wear this bandana. This way my boys won't attack you.
   mpoload 31709
   give bandana $n
endif
~

>give_prog i31706~
    if quest(0, 4, $n) == 2
        mpecho $i opens the letter and reads it.
        say Excellent, he has agreed to my plan.
        say Well done. Thank you.
        say Here, take this. You might need it.
        mpquiet on
        mpoload 31710
        mpjunk i31706
        c 'giant strength' $n
        mpquiet off
        give pass $n
        mpmset $n quest 0 4 3
    else
        say What is this for? I dont need it.
        mpjunk i31706
    endif
~
>all_greet_prog 100~
if quest(0, 4, $n) == 9 
   tell $n I guess the King thinks very highly of you!
else
   if quest(0, 4, $n) == 10
      tell $n I guess the King thinks very highly of you!
   endif
endif
~
|
