#31700
City Entrance~
{160}Before you, stands the largest wooden doors you have ever seen.  Your 
body shivers with goose bumps and your stomach tightens as you approach the
entrance.  You reflect back for a quick moment on the story your father told 
you about the wise and good King Eliador of Saurong, and his great 
contributions to a society of people.  But now something bad has happened with
the great King and his city. The city looks to be in physical disarray, as wars
and constant bombardment of outsiders seems to be the on going lifestyle for 
this city. Type 'help saurong' for any additional information.~
317 ROOM_NO_CASTLE|ROOM_NO_MOB SECT_CITY
DDIR_SOUTH
~
~
0 -1 32098
S
#31701
Camden Street~
{160}As the large wooden gates shut behind you, you gaze at the large walls
that surround the perimeter of the city.  It looks as though it is very well
guarded from outside attackers. As you look up at the buildings around you,
it appears as though the city is in need of a clean up crew. The once
beautifully laid cobblestone path is now littered with debris. A lookout
tower is to the west, and Camden street continues north and east.~
