#31904
Wizard and Riddles~
{160}You're not sure at this point whether your body can handle much more of
this transporting. You are beginning to feel clostrophobic. You haven't seen
the sunshine in quite some time now. the room is full of different colored
candles. The shadows of the lights flickering are in itself awesome. The
smell of the decrepit hallway behind you, is now overpowered by the sweet
smell of incense. A very robust wizard stands here with his back towards you.~
