#31906
In Front of The Moat~
{160}As you approach the castle, your breath is taken by the shear
magnificence of its construction. It appears as though the architect took
great pride in his/her work. Oil and blood stains the outer walls. And in a
few spots you can see where soldiers have tried to traverse its height. A
moat circles its perimeter, with huge alligators swimming about. The
drawbridge is up, so it doesnt look as though you can go in at this time.~
